# Advanced Excel

Welcome to my Advanced Excel practice repository!

This folder contains the Excel assignments and practical tasks I have completed while learning Advanced Excel for Data Analytics.

Through these assignments, I am practicing Excel formulas, functions, logical operations, lookup functions, data analysis, and other important techniques used in real-world data analysis.

### Topics Covered
- Basic Excel Formulas and Functions
- Logical Functions (IF, AND, OR)
- Lookup Functions (VLOOKUP, INDEX, MATCH)
- Text and Date Functions
- Conditional Calculations
- Data Analysis
- Advanced Lookup Techniques

Each assignment is uploaded individually with its corresponding description to document my learning and practical progress.

**Goal:** To strengthen my Excel skills and apply them effectively in Data Analytics.
